        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 767,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 825,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 768,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127346,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 768,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 826,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 769,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127347,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 769,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Pleomorphic fibroma affects the extremities, trunk, and head and neck {23506010; 2916726; 33534206}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 827,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 770,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127348,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 770,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The tumours are painless, single, slow-growing, fleshy polyps or papules {23506010; 2916726; 33534206}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 828,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 771,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127349,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 771,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>This fibroma occurs in middle-aged adults {23506010; 2916726; 33534206}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 829,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 772,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127350,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 772,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Pleomorphic fibromas, when multiple and in young patients, may be associated with a genetic cancer syndrome involving <em>TP53</em> (Li&ndash;Fraumeni syndrome) {32187703}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 830,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 773,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127351,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 773,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These tumours have <em>RB1</em> deletion and are negative for <em>MDM2</em> amplification {28543636; 2916726}. Cases associated with Li&ndash;Fraumeni syndrome harbour <em>TP53</em> germline mutations {32187703}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 837,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 780,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127352,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 780,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Pleomorphic fibromas are small, dome-shaped to polypoid, and relatively well circumscribed.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 831,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 774,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127353,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 774,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These tumours are hypocellular and composed of dense, haphazardly arranged collagen bundles admixed with spindle cells and large pleomorphic cells that have hyperchromatic multilobulated nuclei with smudgy chromatin {23506010; 2916726}.</p>\r\n<h6>Immunohistochemistry</h6>\r\n<p>They are positive for CD34 and show loss of RB1 expression {28543636; 33534206}. There is aberrant p53 expression in Li&ndash;Fraumeni syndrome&ndash;associated cases {32187703}.</p>\r\n<h6>Differential diagnosis</h6>\r\n<p>The differential diagnosis includes superficial atypical lipomatous tumour, pleomorphic lipoma, and atypical fibroxanthoma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 832,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 775,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127354,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 775,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 833,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 776,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127355,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 776,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 836,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 779,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127356,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 779,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> dermal dome-shaped to polypoid tumours; dense, haphazardly arranged collagen bundles; hypocellular spindle cells and large pleomorphic cells with hyperchromatic, smudgy chromatin.</p>\r\n<p><em>Desirable:</em> loss of RB1 expression by immunohistochemistry.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 834,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 777,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127357,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 777,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 835,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 778,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 127358,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 385,
        "headingId": 778,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These are benign tumours, with rare recurrence {23506010; 2916726}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T09:39:25"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
